SUMMARY:Exhibit Opening: The Doctor Is In
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the opening of The Doctor Is In\, a new permanent exhibit at the Pope House Museum! Explore the experiences\, challenges\, and achievements of Black physicians in the 20th-century South through original artifacts from the renowned Pope Collection. Discover an important chapter of medical history and the contributions of Black medical professionals. \nJoin us Saturday\, November 14\, from 10 a.m. to 4 p.m. Admission is free\, all ages are welcome\, and no registration is required. \nLocation: Pope House Museum\nDate: Saturday\, Nov. 14\nTime: 10 a.m. – 4 p.m.\nAges: All\nCosts: Free\nNo Registration Required
URL:https://nchumanities.org/event/exhibit-opening-the-doctor-is-in/
LOCATION:Pope House Museum\, 511 S Wilmington St\, Raleigh\, NC\, NC\, 27601\, United States
CATEGORIES:Humanities Sector Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://nchumanities.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Pope_House_Juneteenth50-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
